R-EC2 R-PUB1 R-PUB4 R-AP27 R-TP2 R-FL5 (slice 221, Design Q507, Q508, Q512): each stop has no request, and the calls of each run end after the read of config.toml. The order of R-PUB4 item 1: direct (exit 2) before --offline (exit 15) before an operand (exit 2) before the repository (empty, not owner/repo) and the ref (a branch) before the OIDC variables (the message names id-token: write). The release route is not there: no run reaches it (the missing permission stops before the release read).
